│                          │ adding parameters.                                                                        │
│                          │ - Uses 4 shared parameters for a final post-RZ layer (same pairing pattern).              │
│                          │ No parametrized controlled rotations are added (they would increase parameter count and   │
│                          │ harmed performance in the current program).                                               │
