│ patch_description        │ Following the optimization strategy of reducing parameter count while maintaining         │
│                          │ expressivity, I am merging the pre-CZ and post-CZ rotation parameters for the RZ layers.  │
│                          │ By using the same parameter keys ("rz_h" and "rz_h2") for both the pre- and post-CZ RZ    │
│                          │ layers, we effectively constrain the circuit to a simpler subspace. This reduction in the │
│                          │ number of free parameters (from 6 per block to 4 per block) often acts as a regularizer,  │
│                          │ helping the model generalize better and potentially accelerating convergence.             │
