│ patch_name               │ hierarchical_parameter_sharing_8qubit_classifier                                          │
│ patch_description        │ This implementation introduces hierarchical parameter sharing to improve the 8-qubit      │
│                          │ binary classifier. Key improvements include:                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Hierarchical parameter sharing across uploads - parameters are now shared across the   │
│                          │ two repeats within each upload, reducing total parameters by ~33% (from 80 to 56)         │
│                          │ 2. Maintains the successful paired qubit structure (0,1), (2,3), etc. for better          │
│                          │ correlation modeling                                                                      │
│                          │ 3. Preserves the interleaved CZ ring structure that showed good performance in previous   │
│                          │ generations                                                                               │
│                          │ 4. Reduces overfitting through more constrained parameter space while maintaining         │
│                          │ expressivity                                                                              │
│                          │ 5. Uses upload-indexed parameter names (e.g., "rx_u0", "ry_0_u1") to enable sharing       │
│                          │ within uploads                                                                            │
│                          │ 6. Keeps the additional CZ chords for better entanglement                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The parameter reduction should improve generalization gap and parameter efficiency while  │
│                          │ maintaining high accuracy. The hierarchical structure allows the circuit to learn         │
│                          │ upload-specific features while sharing knowledge within each upload's repeats.            │
